<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 445 MLN NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 445 MLN NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bid for 273 million zlotys worth of 91-day NBP-bills and for 172 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills, the NBP said.</p>
<p>Results of the sale should be available at about 1300 local time.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
